  361: /// recent candidates are read first - (wave 29, E27) a codex-named process too; TEST HOOK (test
  362: /// mode only): `CODEX_CONSULT_TEST_CMDLINE_UNREADABLE=<pid>[,<pid>]` - these pids are scanned with
  363: /// the command line `''`). A table that could not be read: `failed`, `<check> could not run`.
  364: fn scan_pass(
